desc:   paper mario deblur (real-world APS-N64 + IPS, cross-validated)

APS-N64  | test/data/paper-mario/deblur.aps | real | N64 NTSC deblur (nointro set); cross-validated with IPS
IPS      | test/data/paper-mario/deblur.ips | real | N64 deblur IPS (CRC-named); cross-validated with APS
